## Project: Building a Safe Data Structure Library

### What You'll Build
A **SafeVec** — a vector type with full contracts, invariants, and verified operations.

### Requirements
1. Type `SafeVec[T]` with invariant: capacity >= length
2. Methods: new, push, pop, get, set, len, capacity
3. Every method has requires + ensures
4. At least 3 methods have xiom-verifiable ensures
5. Write property-based tests
6. Document your design decisions

